Cell["\<\
n is a nonnegative integer. The output list has n+1 elements; element p+1 \
contains the rank-p momentum-derivative tensor, ending in two matrix indices.\
\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1457976114,ExpressionUUID->"4d7c1336-24aa-ac4c-9d07-32a80ee531db"],

Cell["\<\
The order-zero element is the Hamiltonian. No hbar factors are inserted.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->684583862,ExpressionUUID->"15b085eb-ddc1-7047-a74c-4ab6809c96a0"],

Cell["\<\
The first entry is onsite; remaining numeric vector keys must map to \
SparseArray matrices and represent one half of the reverse-hopping pairs.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->207034004,ExpressionUUID->"a066671e-6169-4e4d-b686-6f00c984f8df"]
}, Closed]],

